# Checklist item 5: dragging a file from the Project view onto the panel.
#
# Two identical drags in a row, because the bug being chased is "the first one does nothing,
# the second works". The composer lives inside JCEF and is invisible to XPath, so the answer
# is in the screenshots — and, for the Kotlin half of the chain, in the plugin's own log
# lines (`FoxxyCode DnD drag #N`, `FoxxyCode DnD drop #N`, `FoxxyCode mention:`).
toolwindow FoxxyCode
sleep 10
screenshot before-any-drag
drag hello.txt
sleep 2
screenshot after-first-drag
drag hello.txt
sleep 2
screenshot after-second-drag
